== Additional Info ==

This theme, like WordPress, is licensed under the GPL.

This theme bundles no third-party code libraries. It optionally loads the
"Plus Jakarta Sans" and "Inter" typefaces from Google Fonts at runtime
(both licensed under the SIL Open Font License); loading them can be
switched off in Appearance > Customize > Colours & Style.
